  and selected 8.6\, PDF pp. 13–16. Recognise chain/position/functional i
 somers and primary/secondary/tertiary carbon types.\n\n2. INDEPENDENT PRAC
 TICE\nWorked Problem 8.9\; reattempt bridge check Q2 and Q4. Recognise ort
 ho/meta/para positions using Q19.\n\n3. CHECK & FINISH\nSimple naming and 
