 maths recall / questions\n15 min — Earlier physics recall / questions\n2
 5 min — The named spaced returns\n5 min — Correct and log\n\n1. LEARN 
 / RECALL\nUse the first 15 minutes for the earlier maths questions\, then 
 15 minutes for the earlier physics questions. Use 25 minutes for the named
  spaced returns in the order listed. Keep the final 5 minutes for checking
  and logging. Recall without notes first\; open the linked cards only to c
 heck.\n\n2. INDEPENDENT PRACTICE\nMaths Q4 and Q33(a)\, PDF pp. 5 and 19\;
  Physics Q23\, PDF p. 15\, with the book closed. Return +3 days: maths Ex.
  5.1 Q3(b)\; organic check Q6\; Solutions Q1.5 concentration units.\n\n3. 
 CHECK & FINISH\nCorrect the attempts\; append at most three useful correct
 ions to the linked chapter notes.\n\nRESOURCES\nPDF page numbers count fro
 m the first file page.\nEarlier maths · paper PDF page 5\nSaved file: Sou
 rces/PYQ/Mathematics/2026/Main/2413-1_65-1-1_Mathematics.pdf · PDF page 5
