 om Q33(a)\, or recompute A inverse if none\; Physics Q1 and Q2. Return +7 
 days: maths Ex. 5.1 Q6\; organic check Q5–6\; identify the correct denom
 inator in Solutions Q1.5.\n\n3. CHECK & FINISH\nCorrect the attempts\; app
 end at most three useful corrections to the linked chapter notes.\n\nRESOU
 RCES\nPDF page numbers count from the first file page.\nEarlier maths · p
 aper PDF page 5\nSaved file: Sources/PYQ/Mathematics/2026/Main/2413-1_65-1
