 ybridisation of each carbon atom in CH3CHO.\nQ6. Count sigma and pi bonds 
 in ethene and ethyne.\n\nANSWER CHECK — read only after attempting the q
 uestions\nQ5. The methyl carbon is sp3\; the carbonyl carbon is sp2.\nQ6. 
